# The enforcement surface. Replace @OWNER with a real human owner. The leading
# catch-all is deliberate: source-level mutation classifications and analyzer
# suppressions can live anywhere, so every change needs the named owner's review.
# Enable the complete protected-branch checklist in README.md; CODEOWNERS alone
# does not dismiss stale approvals or prevent bypass. Directory.Build.props,
# Directory.Packages.props, and .editorconfig are unanchored on purpose:
# MSBuild and the analyzers resolve them nearest-first, so a nested copy
# shadows the wall. If the mise task fragment (20-csharp.toml) lives outside
# /.config/mise/, add its path here.
